th match, suggesting this ordering might be the right key.\n\nVerifying against ex1 and ex2 with leftmost-column ordering confirms the same wrap-around chain pattern holds. So the rule is: order shapes by leftmost column, each takes the color of the previous shape in that order, wrapping around. Now I need to apply this to the test input.\n\n",
